OL,3,GNEWSAAmphibious car's nine-mile charity
OL,4,Ajourney
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amphibious car has set off on a
OL,7,Fnine-mile journey from Guernsey to Sark
OL,8,Fto raise money for the St John Marine
OL,9,FAmbulance.
OL,11,FThe car has been transformed by marine
OL,12,Fambulance crew volunteers with the
OL,13,Fsupport of local businesses.
OL,15,FIt left from Old Lifeboat Slipway, near
OL,16,Fthe Model Yacht Pond on Guernsey's
OL,17,FCastle Emplacement, at about 09:30 BST.
OL,19,FPaul Philips and Gary Ward will crew
OL,20,Fthe vessel - the same two volunteers
OL,21,Fwho completed a similar challenge in
OL,22,F1992.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
